{
  "id": "b2-e06-eating-habits",
  "level": "B2",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Eating habits",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know something about you.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what kind of food do you like to eat?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you enjoy cooking? Why or why not?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how has the food you eat changed since you were a child?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think you eat in a healthy way?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you two photographs. I'd like you to talk about them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question about your partner's photographs.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e06-a1",
            "b2-e06-a2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your photographs show people getting food. Compare the photographs, and say why the people might have chosen to get their food in these ways.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10300
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these ways do you prefer? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b2-e06-b1",
            "b2-e06-b2"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your photographs show people eating out. Compare the photographs, and say what the people might enjoy about eating in these places.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 9800
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, where would you prefer to eat with friends? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that can make it easier for people to eat healthily, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11200
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "b2-e06-eating-habits",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these things help people eat in a healthier way?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "b2-e06-eating-habits",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most effective?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about food and lifestyle.",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Some people say that healthy food is only for people who can afford it. What do you think?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think people know enough about what they eat?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, how important is it to eat meals together with family or friends?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Should governments tax unhealthy food?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, why do you think some people find it so difficult to change their eating habits?",
          "audio": "audio/B2/b2-e06-eating-habits/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6200
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
